{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3eURnLpGjHUZz8UP4N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set in a stone frame. There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*The keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*You feel the weight of something in your pocket you didn't have before.*\n\n*I wait. I have always been waiting.*\n\n*A draft seeps through me from the other side — carrying the scent of dust, old paper, and something almost like rain. Almost like memory.*\n\n**Insert the key?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":116,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}